+//        neither by the sender nor by the Mac launcher after the host; the player's "offline" choice with the cloud unreadable all along sends nothing
+//   (12) the first play on a new Mac, the cloud's save not read at the start: the new save does not replace the cloud's progress; the next start asks; the
+//        player's choice of the cloud's brings it in and keeps the new one
